{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/reproduction/cell-division/","source":"students/subjects/biology/reproduction/cell-division.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Cell Division & Growth | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/reproduction/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Reproduction &amp; Development</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Cell Division &amp; Growth</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">Understanding cellular reproduction and growth regulation</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand the cell cycle and its regulation</li>\n                        <li>• Compare and contrast mitosis and meiosis</li>\n                        <li>• Explain growth control mechanisms</li>\n                        <li>• Analyze the relationship between cell division and cancer</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Cell Division Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: The Cell Cycle</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Stages and regulation of cell division</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: Mitosis vs Meiosis</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Comparing types of cell division</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. The Cell Cycle</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Interphase:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- G1 phase</li>\n                                    <li>- S phase</li>\n                                    <li>- G2 phase</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Cell division phases:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Prophase</li>\n                                    <li>- Metaphase</li>\n                                    <li>- Anaphase</li>\n                                    <li>- Telophase</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Checkpoints and regulation</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Mitosis</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Purpose and function</li>\n                            <li>• Chromosome behavior:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- DNA replication</li>\n                                    <li>- Chromosome segregation</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Cytokinesis</li>\n                            <li>• Cell growth</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Meiosis</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Purpose in reproduction</li>\n                            <li>• Two divisions:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Meiosis I</li>\n                                    <li>- Meiosis II</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Genetic variation:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Crossing over</li>\n                                    <li>- Independent assortment</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Growth Control</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Growth factors</li>\n                            <li>• Contact inhibition</li>\n                            <li>• Cancer development:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Proto-oncogenes</li>\n                                    <li>- Tumor suppressors</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Microscopy Lab</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Observe onion root tip cells</li>\n                                <li>• Identify mitotic stages</li>\n                                <li>• Calculate mitotic index</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Growth Studies</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Yeast culture growth</li>\n                                <li>• Effect of temperature</li>\n                                <li>• Growth curve analysis</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Compare and contrast mitosis and meiosis.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include purpose, process, and outcomes.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Explain how the cell cycle is regulated.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include checkpoints and control mechanisms.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Describe how normal cell division becomes cancerous.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Include genetic and environmental factors.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}